    "definition_type_raw": "Teamwork",
    "source_book_raw": "Antihero's Handbook pg. 10",
    "definition_raw": "Source Antihero's Handbook pg. 10\nWhen your ally is in the area of effect of a harmful spell, your foes are caught off guard.\n\nBenefit: When an ally who also has this feat fails her saving throw (including voluntarily failing the save) against a spell that would harm her with an area of effect that includes her, intelligent enemies within the spell’s area take a –2 penalty on their saving throws to resist the spell’s effects.",
